#. <CLT 3>“思い出”<CLT>…って事だろ？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was...<CLT 3>our past<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. わーい！　また苗木クンが正解しちゃいましたー！
#. そうでーす、あの事件で動機となったのは…
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Yaaay! Makoto got it right again! That time, the theme\n"
"was..."
msgstr ""

#. “恥ずかしい思い出”や、
#. “知られたくない過去”なのでした！　きゃっ！
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "...embarrassing memories and secrets! Kyah!"
msgstr ""

#. それをバラされたくなかったからこそ、
#. 大和田クンの事件は、起きちゃったんだよねー！
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And the whole reason Mondo did what he did was to\n"
"protect his secret!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、どうした…？
#. いつまで続けるつもりだ？
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So...? How long do you plan on dragging this out?"
msgstr ""

#. いいから、いいから！
#. じゃあ、次のクイズねー！！
msgctxt "0006 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Relax, relax! Okay, on to the next question!"
msgstr ""

#. ３番目の殺人の時に、動機となったのは、
#. さてさて、なーんでしょーうか！？
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Sooo, what was the motive for the third murder!?"
msgstr ""

#. 欲望
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Greed"
msgstr ""

#. 人望
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Popularity"
msgstr ""

#. 人望…？
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Popularity...?"
msgstr ""

#. 人望がない人が濡れ衣を着せられちゃうとか、
#. そういう話…？
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Are you saying, like, whoever's unpopular gets framed\n"
"for murder or something like that?"
msgstr ""

#. 人望がないヤツが
#. 濡れ衣を着せらんのは仕方ねーべ！
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well if you're so unpopular that someone wants to\n"
"frame you, them's the breaks, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クン…自分が犯人にされそうになった事、
#. 忘れたのかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did he already forget how someone tried to frame\n"
"*him*?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく、人望とかそういう事じゃなくて、
#. あの殺人にはもっとストレートな動機があったはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anyway, I don't think that was it. I think the motive\n"
"was more straightforward...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 展望
msgctxt "0016 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "A new outlook"
msgstr ""

#. 世の中暗ーい事ばっかり…
#. もし将来の明るい展望が見えたら、嬉しいですね…
msgctxt "0017 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"There's so much darkness in the world. If I can just\n"
"get a bright new outlook on the future, I could..."
msgstr ""

#. なんて冗談です。
#. 超ハズレなのです！
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What a joke! You totally missed the mark. Super miss!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言えば、あの時モノクマは、
#. 卒業生にはプレゼントがあるって言って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You know, I think I remember Monokuma offering us some\n"
"kind of \"graduation present\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ほらほら、思い出してごらんよ！
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Come on, you gotta remember!"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸クンと山田クンが殺された、
#. あの３番目の殺人をさ…！
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That third murder! The chain homicide of Taka and\n"
"Hifumi!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時…モノクマは…
#. 卒業生には１００億円あげるとか言ったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma told us that whoever graduated, he'd give\n"
"them 10 million dollars...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>３番目の殺人の時の…動機のテーマは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The theme for the third murder was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>３番目の殺人の時の…動機のテーマは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The theme for the third murder was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時、セレスさんが人を殺した理由は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason Celeste turned to murder was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>西洋の城を買うとか…
#. 世界中のイケメンを集めるとか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She wanted to buy a European castle...and live there\n"
"with a bunch of \"handsome men\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、３番目の殺人の時、
#. ボクらに提示された動機のテーマって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that time, the motive for murder was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
